==Changelog - July 29th==
{{Collapsed section|18|CLICK HERE TO SHOW}}
'''Wyrmscraig is OUT NOW!'''

* Sail to Wyrmscraig, a brand-new island made in partnership with [https://x.com/ScreteMonge Gnome], the winner of our Player-Designed Island competition! Immerse yourself in a brand-new quest, meet a new Slayer Master, take down the repeatable Mad Angel boss, and try two brand new skilling activities!
** You'll require 62 Sailing to get to the island. Once unlocked, you can participate in Goat Hunting with 60 Hunter.
** To start Fallen From Grace, you'll need 62 Sailing, 60 Crafting, 47 Runecraft, and 53 Mining.
*** This is an Experienced-tier quest which unlocks the repeatable boss and Sunstone Golem Crafting.
**** Remember to bring your Hunter Furs along for Golem Crafting, since it's a required part of this activity.
*** You'll also need to start this quest to access Mortimer (found in the caverns during the quest). Mortimer requires 70 Slayer and 100 Combat, or 99 Slayer.
** New rewards await those who venture to Wyrmscraig, including:
*** Hallowfell:
**** A powerful two-handed sword that requires 75 Attack to wield and is dropped from the repeatable boss.
**** Every swing cleaves through nearby enemies, hitting up to two additional targets.
**** Against three monsters it actually outperforms every other melee weapon currently available, making it a very juicy upgrade for all different types of accounts.
*** Jeweller's Chisel:
**** Earned from Golem Crafting
**** A 20% increased chance to successfully cut Opals, Jades and Topaz.
**** A 10% chance to cut two gems at once when cutting any gem.
**** Guaranteed success when cutting:
***** Opals at Level 62.
***** Jades at Level 71.
***** Topaz at Level 76.
**** Works as a regular Chisel

An additional Sailing change:

* Added the 'Teleport to Boat' spell as an additional Sailing Skillcape perk. The Greater Teleport Focus facility is still required to use it.

====Other Changes====

* Renamed 'NPC Contact' to 'Astral Contact' to give it an immersive and lore accurate name, much like other spells have.
* Updated the Maggot King sacrifice messaging from ‘double pet chance’ to ‘improved pet chance’ to better reflect how the mechanic works.
** Sacrificing replaces the standard pet roll with a chance to receive an egg. The overall chance of receiving the pet across all egg rarities has not changed and remains roughly double the normal rate.
* The Special Attack description tooltip for the Tonalztics of Ralos has been updated.
* The Avernic Defender and all of its variants will no longer be protected over items of higher value. All versions of the Avernic Defender will be valued at 600,000 GP, matching their repair cost.

====PvP Rota====

The PvP rota has moved to '''Period A''':

* 539 - (US) - PvP World
* 318 - (UK) - Bounty Hunter World
* 548 - (Germany) - High-Risk PvP World
* 577 - (US) - Free-to-Play PvP World
