You’ll now unlock more interesting tasks much earlier in your journey, and we'll be keeping a watchful eye on community feedback over the coming days and weeks.

Let us know how these tasks feel in practice, and we'll be ready to make further adjustments if needed! 

===Partner Slayer===
We've had a few questions pop up about Mortimer and Partner Slayer.

When choosing a task, your available options will be determined'' independently'' of your partner's unlocks and requirements. This means your partner cannot reduce or alter your task pool.

If you select a task that your partner doesn't meet the Slayer level or quest requirements for, you'll still receive the assignment as normal. 

Additionally, your partner cannot be assigned your task if they have a task choice pending with Mortimer.

===NPC Contact===
While working on Mortimer, we realised this would be a good opportunity to address the fact that 'NPC Contact' sounded a bit too fourth-wall-y. We've now renamed it to Astral Contact to give it an immersive and lore accurate name, much like other spells have.

