[[File:Wyrmscraig Is Out Today! (14).png|center|500px]]

Do you want to show off your artistic talents? We'd love to see your work!

Get creative, interpret in your own way, and submit your artwork to the RAC Discord before 13th August for a chance to win some Bonds!

====Prizes====
15 Old School RuneScape (OSRS) Bonds will be awarded to the winners:


* x1 Grand Prize Winner - 6 OSRS Bonds.
* x2 Runner-Ups – each Runner-Up receives 3 OSRS Bonds.
* x3 Bonus Category Winners (Most Creative, Most Unique and Funniest) - each Bonus Category Winner receives 1 OSRS Bond.

====How to enter:====

* Create an original piece inspired by Wyrmscraig. It could be anything you like. A postcard, piece of concept art, you name it.
* Post it in the competition thread on the <u>[https://discord.gg/gqr2wQ4Bv RAC Discord]</u>. Include your RSN within your entry.
* Be sure to read the rules posted on the server before entering,
* Check out the Terms and Conditions <u>[https://osrs.game/RAC-Discord-T&Cs here]</u>.

We'd love to feature your work on our channels and see what you come up with.

The team can't wait to see what you create!

