===Pre-Orders Re-Opened for Monopoly: RuneScape Edition===
[[File:Wyrmscraig Is Out Today! (15).jpg|center|600px]]

Thank you so much for the interest you've shown for Monopoly: RuneScape edition!

We're delighted to see the level of demand and we're re-opening pre-orders for Monopoly: RuneScape edition on the [https://runescapemerch.com/ official merch store] so everyone has a chance to get one. This second production run has no order limit until August 17th. To ensure you secure yours, place your pre-order by that date! After that date, production quantities will be finalised, and any extra stock will be available until it sells out. Also, please note that this second batch will ship in February 2027.

We know some of you had some questions regarding why the board game sold out during a pre-order run, and this is due to the first pre-order round being a production run that was already in progress to leave the factory. Due to production quantities being finalised, the store could only accept pre-orders up to the amount manufactured at the time. We've also seen questions regarding the board and why some details aren't RuneScape-themed. This is due to the owners of Monopoly, Hasbro, having certain guidelines around what can and can't be changed on the board; you can see this reflected in other Monopoly board partnerships! Nevertheless, the team have customised every inch of the board that we were allowed to with:

* RuneScape Game Board
* 6 Exclusive Antique Gold Metal RuneScape Tokens
* 28 Gielinor Title Deed Cards
* 16 Random Event Chance Cards
* 16 OSRS Community Chest Cards
* 32 POH Houses
* 12 Lumbridge Tower Style Castles
* Gielinor Money Pack
* OSRS Game Guide

[[File:Wyrmscraig Is Out Today! (16).jpg|center|450px]]

